+## 5. Rule-by-rule static soundness review
+
+The complete source-level inventory is
+`evidence/rule_inventory.tsv` (SHA-256
+`22f94fe154f1e67e6e580a3dd2e92f94bac2cb35aada89781e3c1250447842c7`).
